before I introduce mr. Jack Valenti the  president of the Motion Picture  Association of America I'd like to say  to you people at home who are taping  this on your Betamax you're all under  arrest and now to present the Jean  Hersholt Humanitarian Award mr. Jack  Valenti  the Jean Hersholt award is the Academy's  most treasured humanitarian prize and  this year it goes to Leo Jaffe the  chairman of the board of Columbia  Pictures in just a few weeks time he  marks his 50th year with that company  certainly nobody can accuse him of  flitting around to mr. Jaffee words like  duty honor excellence caring for others  a crucial rules of life too often in our  times these words are bruised by  inattention or disfigured by callous  neglect but to mr. Jaffe their beacon  lights to live by I know of no one in  our industry more worthy of receiving  the Jean Hersholt Humanitarian Award  ladies and gentlemen mr. Leo Jaffe  thank you jack for gracious introduction  and remarks I am indeed overwhelmed by  this prestigious meaningful award I  thank each and every member of the  Academy and the Board of Directors for  the honor being bestowed upon me tonight  I appreciate the support given to me by  my colleagues and associates at Columbia  Pictures I also take this opportunity to  publicly thank my gracious wife Anita my  children and grandchildren for their  understanding and constant support and  often sacrifices and enabling me to  participate in this work that is so dear  to me while our vast audience throughout  the world look to our industry to  provide entertainment it is important to  stress the fact we often overlooked that  all segments of the industry are  responsible people who are very  responsive to the communal needs and  other problems that confront us they  give generously of their time talents  and efforts and financial resources to  many worthwhile causes be they  philanthropic Civic or educational that  will help improve the quality of life I  am proud to be part of an industry that  there's so much for so many thank you  all for making it such a memorable  evening for me
 

